{"content_hash": "15c4ed374f1a46f9", "version_id": 845, "article_id": 85, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "Saudi Aramco buys 49% of AI firm HUMAIN from PIF", "title_zh": "沙特阿美买下 HUMAIN 49% 股份，主权基金留控股权", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ithome", "source_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/020/863.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580163059128-129fad4b73fb?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8aHVtYWlufGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTM1ODExNDh8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by tangi bertin on Unsplash", "author": "tangi bertin", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@tangib?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/2-people-walking-on-pathway-between-bare-trees-during-foggy-weather-reLB6gIk7to?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(140, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(178, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "3d04ad25edfd"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-02", "word_count": 215, "reading_minutes": 1.1, "lead": "Saudi Arabia's state oil giant is taking a near-half stake in the kingdom's flagship AI startup, paying largely in assets and cash as it seeks to turn artificial intelligence into industrial muscle.", "lead_zh": "沙特国有石油巨头将入股本国旗舰人工智能初创企业近一半，主要以资产和现金支付，意在把人工智能转化为工业实力。", "preview": "HUMAIN, the artificial intelligence venture until now wholly owned by Saudi Arabia's Public Investment Fund (PIF), announced on the first of", "preview_zh": "此前由沙特阿拉伯公共投资基金（PIF）全资持有的人工智能企业 HUMAIN 本月 1 日宣布，全球最大石化企业沙特阿美将收购该公司 49% 的股份。主权财富基金将保留其余 51%，继续对这家被视为沙特先进计算雄心核心的企业保持控股。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 829, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 98.375, "size_bytes": 591264, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 240, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_c1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 99.825, "size_bytes": 599904, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 240, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/85/en_c1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_c1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 105.95, "size_bytes": 636624, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 240, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/85/en_c1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_c1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 92.625, "size_bytes": 556704, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 240, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/85/en_c1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/85/en_c1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 99.925, "size_bytes": 600480, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 240, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/85/en_c1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@b7c82c2/content/data/versions/845.json", "paragraphs": ["HUMAIN, the artificial intelligence venture until now wholly owned by Saudi Arabia's Public Investment Fund (PIF), announced on the first of this month that Aramco, the world's largest petrochemicals company, will acquire a 49% stake in the business. The sovereign wealth fund will retain the remaining 51%, preserving majority control over a company widely seen as central to the kingdom's ambitions in advanced computing.", "The transaction is expected to be settled not in cash alone but through the transfer of key artificial intelligence assets alongside a capital injection of roughly 9.9 billion Saudi riyals. Such an arrangement allows Aramco to fold existing capabilities into the venture while giving HUMAIN the balance-sheet strength to scale infrastructure that AI development demands.", "Aramco reportedly intends to draw on HUMAIN's computing infrastructure to convert advanced AI capabilities into industrial applications, thereby reinforcing its global ecosystem and operational capacity. For the oil producer, the appeal lies in efficiency gains across refining, exploration and logistics; for HUMAIN, the tie-up offers an anchor customer with deep pockets and global reach.", "The deal underscores how Gulf states are racing to build domestic AI champions, pairing sovereign capital with energy-sector demand. Whether the partnership delivers tangible industrial results, or remains largely a statement of intent, will be watched closely by rivals assembling similar alliances."], "paragraphs_zh": ["此前由沙特阿拉伯公共投资基金（PIF）全资持有的人工智能企业 HUMAIN 本月 1 日宣布，全球最大石化企业沙特阿美将收购该公司 49% 的股份。主权财富基金将保留其余 51%，继续对这家被视为沙特先进计算雄心核心的企业保持控股。", "这笔交易预计不会仅以现金结算，而是通过转让关键人工智能资产，外加约 99 亿沙特里亚尔的注资来完成。这样的安排让沙特阿美得以把现有能力并入该合资企业，同时赋予 HUMAIN 扩张人工智能开发所需基础设施的资产负债表实力。", "据报道，沙特阿美打算借助 HUMAIN 的算力基础设施，把先进人工智能能力转化为工业应用，从而强化其全球生态与运营能力。对这家石油生产商而言，吸引力在于炼化、勘探和物流环节的效率提升；对 HUMAIN 来说，这笔合作带来了一个财力雄厚、触达全球的锚定客户。", "该交易凸显海湾国家正争相打造本土人工智能领军企业，把主权资本与能源行业需求结合起来。这一合作究竟能带来实实在在的工业成果，还是大体停留在意向层面，将受到正在组建类似联盟的竞争对手密切关注。"], "body": "HUMAIN, the artificial intelligence venture until now wholly owned by Saudi Arabia's Public Investment Fund (PIF), announced on the first of this month that Aramco, the world's largest petrochemicals company, will acquire a 49% stake in the business. The sovereign wealth fund will retain the remaining 51%, preserving majority control over a company widely seen as central to the kingdom's ambitions in advanced computing.\n\nThe transaction is expected to be settled not in cash alone but through the transfer of key artificial intelligence assets alongside a capital injection of roughly 9.9 billion Saudi riyals. Such an arrangement allows Aramco to fold existing capabilities into the venture while giving HUMAIN the balance-sheet strength to scale infrastructure that AI development demands.\n\nAramco reportedly intends to draw on HUMAIN's computing infrastructure to convert advanced AI capabilities into industrial applications, thereby reinforcing its global ecosystem and operational capacity. For the oil producer, the appeal lies in efficiency gains across refining, exploration and logistics; for HUMAIN, the tie-up offers an anchor customer with deep pockets and global reach.\n\nThe deal underscores how Gulf states are racing to build domestic AI champions, pairing sovereign capital with energy-sector demand. Whether the partnership delivers tangible industrial results, or remains largely a statement of intent, will be watched closely by rivals assembling similar alliances.", "body_zh": "此前由沙特阿拉伯公共投资基金（PIF）全资持有的人工智能企业 HUMAIN 本月 1 日宣布，全球最大石化企业沙特阿美将收购该公司 49% 的股份。主权财富基金将保留其余 51%，继续对这家被视为沙特先进计算雄心核心的企业保持控股。\n\n这笔交易预计不会仅以现金结算，而是通过转让关键人工智能资产，外加约 99 亿沙特里亚尔的注资来完成。这样的安排让沙特阿美得以把现有能力并入该合资企业，同时赋予 HUMAIN 扩张人工智能开发所需基础设施的资产负债表实力。\n\n据报道，沙特阿美打算借助 HUMAIN 的算力基础设施，把先进人工智能能力转化为工业应用，从而强化其全球生态与运营能力。对这家石油生产商而言，吸引力在于炼化、勘探和物流环节的效率提升；对 HUMAIN 来说，这笔合作带来了一个财力雄厚、触达全球的锚定客户。\n\n该交易凸显海湾国家正争相打造本土人工智能领军企业，把主权资本与能源行业需求结合起来。这一合作究竟能带来实实在在的工业成果，还是大体停留在意向层面，将受到正在组建类似联盟的竞争对手密切关注。", "text": "HUMAIN, the artificial intelligence venture until now wholly owned by Saudi Arabia's Public Investment Fund (PIF), announced on the first of this month that Aramco, the world's largest petrochemicals company, will acquire a 49% stake in the business. The sovereign wealth fund will retain the remaining 51%, preserving majority control over a company widely seen as central to the kingdom's ambitions in advanced computing. The transaction is expected to be settled not in cash alone but through the transfer of key artificial intelligence assets alongside a capital injection of roughly 9.9 billion Saudi riyals. Such an arrangement allows Aramco to fold existing capabilities into the venture while giving HUMAIN the balance-sheet strength to scale infrastructure that AI development demands. Aramco reportedly intends to draw on HUMAIN's computing infrastructure to convert advanced AI capabilities into industrial applications, thereby reinforcing its global ecosystem and operational capacity. For the oil producer, the appeal lies in efficiency gains across refining, exploration and logistics; for HUMAIN, the tie-up offers an anchor customer with deep pockets and global reach. The deal underscores how Gulf states are racing to build domestic AI champions, pairing sovereign capital with energy-sector demand. Whether the partnership delivers tangible industrial results, or remains largely a statement of intent, will be watched closely by rivals assembling similar alliances.", "vocab": [{"word": "stake", "pos": "noun", "zh": "股份；利害关系", "note": "商务新闻高频词，acquire a stake in 表示入股", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sovereign wealth fund", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "主权财富基金", "note": "指国家设立的投资基金，缩写 SWF", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "retain", "pos": "verb", "zh": "保留；保持", "note": "比 keep 正式，常用于股权、控制权语境", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "majority control", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "控股权", "note": "与 minority stake 相对", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "settle", "pos": "verb", "zh": "结算；了结", "note": "金融语境指完成支付或交易交割", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "capital injection", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "注资；资本注入", "note": "也可说 cash injection", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fold into", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "并入；整合进", "note": "形象说法，指把某事物纳入更大整体", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "balance-sheet strength", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "资产负债表实力；财务实力", "note": "财经报道常用，指企业资金充裕", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "scale", "pos": "verb", "zh": "扩大规模", "note": "动词用法，scale infrastructure 指扩大基础设施", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "draw on", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "利用；借助", "note": "后接资源、经验等抽象名词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "anchor customer", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "锚定客户；主力客户", "note": "指能稳定支撑业务的大客户", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "deep pockets", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "财力雄厚", "note": "口语化但常见于商业报道", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "underscore", "pos": "verb", "zh": "凸显；强调", "note": "新闻写作中替代 show、highlight", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "statement of intent", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "意向声明；表态", "note": "暗含“只有姿态、未必落实”的意味", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-02T00:59:06.345153", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "HUMAIN", "s": 0.3, "e": 1.425, "sm": 300, "em": 1425, "cs": 0, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": ",", "s": 1.425, "e": 1.525, "sm": 1425, "em": 1524, "cs": 6, "ce": 7, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "the", "s": 1.525, "e": 1.675, "sm": 1525, "em": 1674, "cs": 8, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "artificial", "s": 1.675, "e": 2.188, "sm": 1675, "em": 2187, "cs": 12, "ce": 22, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "intelligence", "s": 2.188, "e": 2.75, "sm": 2187, "em": 2750, "cs": 23, "ce": 35, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "venture", "s": 2.75, "e": 3.425, "sm": 2750, "em": 3424, "cs": 36, "ce": 43, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "until", "s": 3.425, "e": 3.75, "sm": 3425, "em": 3750, "cs": 44, "ce": 49, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "now", "s": 3.75, "e": 3.975, "sm": 3750, "em": 3975, "cs": 50, "ce": 53, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "wholly", "s": 3.975, "e": 4.325, "sm": 3975, "em": 4325, "cs": 54, "ce": 60, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "owned", "s": 4.325, "e": 4.6, "sm": 4325, "em": 4599, "cs": 61, "ce": 66, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": "by", "s": 4.6, "e": 4.787, "sm": 4600, "em": 4787, "cs": 67, "ce": 69, "si": 0}, {"i": 11, "w": "Saudi", "s": 4.787, "e": 5.125, "sm": 4787, "em": 5125, "cs": 70, "ce": 75, "si": 0}, {"i": 12, "w": "Arabia's", "s": 5.125, "e": 5.7, "sm": 5125, "em": 5700, "cs": 76, "ce": 84, "si": 0}, {"i": 13, "w": "Public", "s": 5.7, "e": 6.062, "sm": 5700, "em": 6062, "cs": 85, "ce": 91, "si": 0}, {"i": 14, "w": "Investment", "s": 6.0